sec.p:
These indices were calculated as follows and are summarized in Table S1 in supporting information:

(A) PL-PX: Mean of PL226/PL224, PL205/PL224, and PL205/PL226;
provides an index of biosynthesis and/or remodeling of ethanolamine plasmalogens based on ratios of concentration of specific sn2 isoforms measured (ie, those containing adrenic acid or 22:4; eicosapentaenoic acid, EPA or 20:5; and docosahexaenoic acid or 22:6)

(A) PL/PE: Mean of PL226/PE226 and PL205/PE226;
provides an index of the ratio of omega-3 fatty acid-containing plasmalogens to the DHA-containing phosphatide PtdEtn 16:0/22:6.
